      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹18.77 (up from ₹14.88 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹33.0b (up 18% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹6.35b (up 26% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 19% (up from 18% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 12% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 10% growth forecast for the Pharmaceuticals industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 25% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 40% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
